			"notes": "### Version 1.1.0+pre.1\n#### Additions\n- Fluid Slot syncing\n- ExtraUIDataKey system, which allows for storing arbitrary data onto a ui holder, with a syncing system for blockentities\n- Add sprite source event\n- New widget system for UISettings, uses an abstraction called UIDrawer, replaces the old sprites list\n- Several widgets added: FluidWidget, ItemWidget, ProgressBarWidget, SpriteWidget, and TextWidget\n- Widgets that conditionally load when a resourcepack is loaded also exist.\n\n#### Removals\n- Sprites list, replaced with widgets\n\n#### Fixes\n- Slot backgrounds for fluid and item slots now use the proper reference to their section, and not the overlay\n\nFull Changelog: https://codeberg.org/Infinitychances/infinity-ui/compare/v1.0.0..v1.1.0+pre.1"
